<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>Kurumdy: unsearched slope band between the interest zone and the objects (2026-08-14, rev. frame footprint)</name>
<description>Blind band computed from all drone clips with gimbal telemetry: full frame footprint projected into terrain (13x8 ray grid, real focal length per moment, obliquity-adjusted scale), 30 m grid. 71 of 235 cells (30%) never appeared in any frame. Note: only 6% of the band was seen at a scale where a lying person is resolvable. Method: alp-finder analysis/coverage_polygon.py; terrain GLO-30 + photogrammetric patches.</description>
<Style id="band"><LineStyle><color>ff3d3dff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>303d3dff</color></PolyStyle></Style>
<Style id="cell"><IconStyle><scale>0.4</scale><color>ff3d3dff</color><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_square.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle></Style>
<Placemark><name>Polygon: band to analyse systematically</name><styleUrl>#band</styleUrl>
